  "name": "ArkeOS",
  "description": "ArkeOS is a full-stack implementation of a custom computer architecture, including a unique word-based instruction set with recursive parameter resolution and conditionality. The ecosystem provides a hardware emulation layer for processors, system bus controllers, and peripherals alongside a dedicated assembler and debugger. Host applications developed in Avalonia and UWP enable cross-platform simulation and interaction with the virtualized environment.",
